title: Windows Update Tracker: Pending updates
agents: windows
catalog: os/misc
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Lists every pending Windows update with KB number, title, classification,
 severity and age. Needs the agent plugin {windows_update_tracker.ps1}.

 Each update is checked against age limits (default: {WARN} after 14 days,
 {CRIT} after 30 days). Age rules can set other limits for certain updates,
 e.g. security updates. The age counts from "first seen on this host" or from
 the Microsoft release date.

 Defender and MSRT updates are ignored by default.

 The service also goes {WARN} if the update search fails or is older than
 2 days ({CRIT} after 7 days).

discovery:
 One service is created if the agent plugin output is present.
